## Error Title
Service Unavailable
 
---
 
## Error ID
KE-SVC-001
 
---
 
## Error Description
503 Service Unavailable
 
---
 
## Root Cause
The dependent service is overloaded, undergoing maintenance, or temporarily down.
 
---
 
## Resolution
- Retry the request after some time.
- Check the health and status of the dependent service.
- Review monitoring dashboards and alerts.
- Escalate to the owning support team if the issue persists.
 
